[{:adr/id "adr-2607141700-cloud-itonami-compliance-fact-federation"
  :adr/doc_type "adr"
  :adr/title "ADR-2607141700: cloud-itonami — federating country/municipality/industry-association compliance facts via datom + DataScript"
  :adr/topic "cloud-itonami-compliance-fact-federation"
  :adr/status "accepted (design + Wave 0 definition only; Wave 0 repo scaffold is a follow-up action, not executed in this ADR)"
  :adr/date "2026-07-14"
  :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"]
  :adr/authoritative true
  :adr/authoritative_for
  ["country-level general-law compliance extends the existing cloud-itonami-iso3166-<country> repos in place (adds a statute.facts namespace alongside the existing marketentry.facts) rather than creating a new repo family"
   "municipality-level compliance is new: cloud-itonami-municipality-<iso3-country>-<city-slug>, WHO-sourced from ooyake's real, Wikidata-provenanced registry/gov-units.capitals.edn (not fabricated), scoped globally per owner decision (major cities across multiple countries from the start)"
   "industry-association-level compliance is new: cloud-itonami-assoc-<isic-code>-<country>-<slug>, scoped 1:1 to cloud-itonami's already-:implemented ISIC verticals (119 total) per owner decision, not an independently invented industry scope"
   "all three axes reuse the same schema/provenance discipline as etzhayyim/global-legislation-datoms (full-text NOT stored, source-url + license + retrieved-at + no-fabrication required) and the same local storage shape (kotoba-lang/datom EAVT facts serialized as a DataScript-ready data/datascript-tx.edn, same as global-legislation-datoms)"
   "cross-repo federated query is NOT net-kotobase (that mesh is L0/L1-only, unconnected to this data) -- interim solution is a thin local script that unions each repo's datascript-tx.edn via d/q, revisited if/when net-kotobase matures"
   "Wave 0 is grounded entirely in already-real data: 6 municipalities drawn from ooyake's capitals.edn for already-:implemented iso3166 countries (JPN/Tokyo, USA/Washington D.C., GBR/London, DEU/Berlin, SGP/Singapore, ZAF/capital-per-ooyake), and 12 ISIC codes already wired into cloud-itonami-isic-8291's compliance-intelligence links (6910, 6810, 6499, 6512, 6419, 6420, 6621, 6622, 6511, 6612, 6920, 6411) -- real association names per code are identified at repo-creation time, not fabricated here"]
