                :verified-run "3 repos (cloud-itonami-iso3166-jpn / etzhayyim/global-legislation-datoms / cloud-itonami-municipality-jpn-tokyo), 572 facts unioned in one DataScript db, cardinality-many `topic` queries now correctly cross-match JPN statutes and Tokyo ordinances"}
